###  CREATE STUDENT RESERVATION
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reservation/student
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{piotrToken}}
X-Building-Id :1 

{
    "StudentId": 4,
    "RoomId": 4,
    "CheckIn": "{{ new Date().toLocaleDateString('sv-SE') }}T00:00:00"
}

### TEST 1: check-in on the 12th of this month (first month -> due on the check-in day)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reservation/student
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{rec1Token}}
X-Building-Id: 1

{ "StudentId": 1, "RoomId": 2, "CheckIn": "2026-11-12T00:00:00" }

### TEST 2: check-in in October (two months of payments: Oct and Nov)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reservation/student
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{rec1Token}}
X-Building-Id: 1

{ "StudentId": 3, "RoomId": 3, "CheckIn": "2026-10-10T00:00:00" }